  }
 },
 "analysis": {
  "min_n": 30,
  "n_boot": 4000,
  "n_perm": 10000,
  "seed": 20261011,
  "alpha": 0.05,
  "note": "also pinned in freeze-C1.json (analysis); report.py refuses 'pre-registered' if it runs with other settings"
 },
 "notes": [
  "Exactly one primary per comparison: metric, exclusions (ops), error policy, CVSS imputation and constant.",
  "cvss_constant 7.5: the median, the mode and the MAE-optimal constant of the FULL NVD CVSS pool (all fetched nvd-cvss items, not the evaluated subset); fixed in R2 before any sealed output exists. Disclosed: chosen with round-1 dev results known (a constant 7.4 guess beat three models on dev MAE).",
  "Margins are decision costs (PROTOCOL C1.10), not power: 0.05 for D4 (owner decision 2026-10-11), D5, D8 and the exploratory D7; 0.10 for D6.full, a prompt choice whose other effect (D6.refuse) is tested separately.",
  "assumed: planning priors for evals/tools/power.py: p_b = B's accuracy, psi = the share of items where A and B disagree, sd_diff = SD of per-item MAE differences (all from round-1 development runs where they exist; D6 and the prospective n are guesses), delta = the smallest effect the decision needs (directional rows).",
  "planned_n: the C1 pool AFTER the primary exclusions (sealed, minus dev_neardup_exposed, minus the declared exclusions; computed from the r4 annotated data (out-r4), text and metadata only); the prospective n is a guess.",
  "Exclusion ops are those report.py knows. Confirmatory pools additionally drop sealed items with meta.rigor.dev_neardup_exposed at selection (the freeze manifest's id lists), before any run.",
  "exploratory_families (D1, D7): pre-specified, never confirmatory; report.py and power.py read only 'families', so they are in no gate, no Holm correction and no power row (owner decisions 2026-10-11).",
  "arms: the approved robustness arms (b) 2x token budget and (c) MCQ option shift, with their decision rules (PROTOCOL C1.13). Arms are exploratory runs; they never change a verdict's direction."
 ],
 "planned_n": {
  "ctibench-mcq": 694,
  "ctibench-vsp": 210,
  "nvd-cwe": 1136,
  "nvd-cvss": 2545,
  "cse-frr": 163,
  "sevenllm-qa": 159,
